# Component and Module Rules

Frontend:

- Page composes components.
- Feature components live under feature directories.
- Shared components live under `frontend/src/components/`.
- API calls must be encapsulated.
- Types must be explicit.
- Do not create huge page files.

Backend:

- Route stays thin.
- Business logic lives in Service.
- Database access lives in Repository.
- Celery Task orchestrates only.
- External API clients live in integrations.

Before editing a page, provide component and module split plan.
